Package: mcmcplots
Type: Package
Title: Create Plots from MCMC Output
Version: 0.4.4
Date: 2026-10-05
Authors@R: c(
	  person("S. McKay", "Curtis", role=c("aut", "cre"), email="s.mckay.curtis@gmail.com")
	, person("Ilya", "Goldin", role="ctb")
	, person("Evangelos", "Evangelou", role="ctb")
	, person("Alex", "Zvoleff", role="ctb")
	, person("sumtxt", role="ctb", comment="GitHub contributor")
	  )
Maintainer: S. McKay Curtis <s.mckay.curtis@gmail.com>
Depends: coda (>= 0.17.1)
Imports: sfsmisc, colorspace, denstrip
Description: Functions for convenient plotting and diagnostic viewing of
    Markov Chain Monte Carlo (MCMC) output. Provides caterpillar plots,
    density plots, trace plots, autocorrelation plots, and HTML reports
    for summarizing and exploring parameter estimates.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/s-mckay-curtis/mcmcplots
BugReports: https://github.com/s-mckay-curtis/mcmcplots/issues
